# Lockfiles — npm is the source of truth (CI runs `npm ci`).
# bun.lockb appears when running `bun add` locally; ignore it so it doesn't
# drift against package-lock.json. See AGENTS.md "bun add desyncs" note.
bun.lockb
bun.lock

